      "content": "i know people say that but it doesnt feel like a weight. it feels like the actual foundation is gone. like some things just happen to you and they change your chemistry or something. i dont think i can just \"take a breath\" and feel better. i feel like i'm just a shell of a person and there isn't even anything left to salvage.",
